			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Rebuild ESBuild artifacts and refresh RouteManifest\n\nTrigger a full recompilation of the Cocoon extension host bundles to propagate recent source changes. Regenerate the `RouteManifest` TypeScript definition and its markdown report, updating the timestamp from 2026-05-19T22:50:39Z to 2026-05-19T23:28:41Z to reflect the current build state.\n\nAll 39 compiled output files in `Target/` (including `Bootstrap`, `Effect`, `gRPC/Server`, and `Handler` layers) and their corresponding source maps are rebuilt to ensure the Node.js sidecar runtime is synchronized with the latest service implementations and method signatures.",
			"SHA": "ff6b00c0f6e076eb3ef9c870683a960f46f3484d"
